	(text "Debug (Rev A) - design notes\n\nJ501: ARM Cortex 10-pin SWD header (2 x 5, 1.27 mm) to the nRF5340 DK debug out (P19) by a 10-pin flat cable.\nPin 3 = GND selects the external target. Voltages must match: run the DK at 3.3 V from P21 (SW10 VEXT->nRF ON,\nSW9 = VDD; DK on USB alone is 3.0 V). Keep DK SB47 open so P19 pin 1 does not drive the badge 3V3.\nVTref = 3V3; nRESET has the module's internal pull-up (no external part); SWO and TDI unused.\nPads: nRESET, SWDIO, SWDCLK, UART TX (P0.22) / RX (P0.23), GND, and six spare GPIO (two analog).\nRear side, reachable with the carrier removed. Nothing on this sheet is measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
